      "desc": {
        "zh": "长对话瘦身：大结果外置成稳定引用、按需回读原文、分级摘要。独立启停，记忆核心关掉也照样压缩。",
        "en": "Shrink long conversations: stable refs for large results, on-demand original readback, tiered summaries. Runs independently of the memory core."
      },
      "summary": {
        "zh": "压缩当前对话，按需回读原文。",
        "en": "Compact the current conversation and retrieve original content."
      },
      "scope": {
        "zh": "负责当前会话的体积与压缩，不代替记忆核心的长期知识管理。",
