        "zh": "自动继续",
        "en": "Auto continue"
      },
      "desc": {
        "zh": "会话因超时或网络报错中断后自动续跑，可限定生效时段；提问带推荐项时自动选。与护栏、压缩共存不打架。",
        "en": "Resume a turn interrupted by a timeout or network error, optionally within chosen hours; auto-select a recommended option when asked. Yields to the guard and compaction modules."
      },
      "summary": {
        "zh": "中断后自动继续，无人值守也能跑下去。",
        "en": "Resume interrupted turns automatically so long runs keep going."
      },
      "scope": {
        "zh": "负责「这一轮没跑完就接着跑」与「有推荐项时替你选」。不裁历史、不管压缩、不约束子代理等待。",
        "en": "Resumes unfinished turns and answers recommended options. Does not compact history or cap subagent waits."
      },
